</Font>
<string name="LocalizedText">Passively increases the &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;Speed boost&lt;/font&gt; after being hit by &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;1&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;3&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt;%. While you are not &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;Winded&lt;/font&gt;, also increase its duration by &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;3&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;4&lt;/font&gt; seconds and apply &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;Winded&lt;/font&gt; for 50 seconds. The speed increase still applies while Winded.

&quot;You with me man? Time to grow up.&quot;</string>
<string name="Name">Desc</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.509999990463</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
