t;{number1} RESET LEFT&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;{number1} RESETS LEFT&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;{number1} RESETS LEFT&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;{number1} Robux&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;{number1} Robux&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;{number1} ROBUX&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;{number1} ROBUX&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;{number1} SCREWS&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;{number1} SCREWS&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;{number1} TO TIER {number2}&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;{number1} TO TIER {number2}&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;{number1},{player1}  Screws&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;{number1},{player1}  Screws&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;{number1}+ ELO&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;{number1}+ ELO&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;{number1}ms&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;{number1}ms&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;{number1}x  Exp&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;{number1}x  Exp&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;{number1}x Emotes&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;{number1}x Emotes&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;•  {number1}  Emblems&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;•  {number1}  Emblems&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;•  {number1}  Screws&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;•  {number1}  Screws&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;•  {number1},{player1}  Emblems&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;•  {number1},{player1}  Emblems&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;•  +{number1}%  permanent  EXP&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;•  +{number1}%  permanent  EXP&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;•  Adrenaline  Shot&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;•  Adrenaline  Shot&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;•  Butcher  unlock&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;•  Butcher  unlock&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;•  Limited  killer  skin&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;•  Limited  killer  skin&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;•  Unique  leaderboard  nametag&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;•  Unique  leaderboard  nametag&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;•  VIP  skins  for  every  killer&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;•  VIP  skins  for  every  killer&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;+{number1} EXP&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;+{number1} EXP&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;+{number1} QUEST REROLL IN {number2}&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;+{number1} QUEST REROLL IN {number2}&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;+{number1} Sin&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;+{number1} Sin&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;+{number1}%  Most  Popular&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;+{number1}%  Most  Popular&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;A bound between the survivor and the candle,\nAfter use, reveals the killer&apos;s aura in rapid succession to you for {number1} seconds. This item has {number2} uses and goes on a cooldown of {number3} seconds after use.\n“Born from the machine’s own wax, its light betrays its creator”&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;A bound between the survivor and the candle,\nAfter use, reveals the killer&apos;s aura in rapid succession to you for {number1} seconds. This item has {number2} uses and goes on a cooldown of {number3} seconds after use.\n“Born from the machine’s own wax, its light betrays its creator”&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;A Little Detached&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;A Little Detached&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;A LITTLE DETACHED&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;A LITTLE DETACHED&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;A Masked sadistic individual obsessed with survivors. Plays around survivors like food, often saving the obsession for the last, as for the other survivors, last thing they hear is his heavy breath under his mask.&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;A Masked sadistic individual obsessed with survivors. Plays around survivors like food, often saving the obsession for the last, as for the other survivors, last thing they hear is his heavy breath under his mask.&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;A relentless force, The Slasher moves undetected and with overwhelming strength, leaving no escape for those who stand in his way.&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;A relentless force, The Slasher moves undetected and with overwhelming strength, leaving no escape for those who stand in his way.&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;A simple bandage, allows you to heal yourself {number1} heath states with each health state taking {number2} seconds to heal.\n\n\&quot;Gone are the days of spamming crouch in order to get healed.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;A simple bandage, allows you to heal yourself {number1} heath states with each health state taking {number2} seconds to heal.\n\n\&quot;Gone are the days of spamming crouch in order to get healed.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;A team of scientists went through years and years of experiments to modify and enhance the human DNA strain.\nMany test subjects were rendered either insane or dead from the experiments, and one of these poor individuals was The Hidden.&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;A team of scientists went through years and years of experiments to modify and enhance the human DNA strain.\nMany test subjects were rendered either insane or dead from the experiments, and one of these poor individuals was The Hidden.&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Ability {number1}&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Ability {number1}&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Abrasive&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&