OF THE GAME&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;THANK YOU FOR SUPPORTING THE DEVELOPMENT OF THE GAME&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;The Abysswalker&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;The Abysswalker&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;The Abysswalker charges up a horizontal slash THAT CAN BE DODGED BY CROUCHING and gains movement speed during build up to unleash an attack that deals damage to more than one survivor. This move can be used to destroy pallets if no one is hit.&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;The Abysswalker charges up a horizontal slash THAT CAN BE DODGED BY CROUCHING and gains movement speed during build up to unleash an attack that deals damage to more than one survivor. This move can be used to destroy pallets if no one is hit.&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;The Abysswalker swings his hand for a long windup and sends out a burst of corruption that travels the whole map, Survivors hit are highlighted for the killer and are slowed by {number1}% for {number2} seconds. Breaking a pallet lowers the slow on every corrupted survivor to {number3}% for the rest of its time.&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;The Abysswalker swings his hand for a long windup and sends out a burst of corruption that travels the whole map, Survivors hit are highlighted for the killer and are slowed by {number1}% for {number2} seconds. Breaking a pallet lowers the slow on every corrupted survivor to {number3}% for the rest of its time.&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;The aura of {number1} unrepaired Generators closest to each other are revealed to you. Repairing these Generators allows you to repair them {number2}% faster, as well as revealing their aura to other Survivors for {number3}/{number4}/{number5} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Strategy won more wars than muscle.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;The aura of {number1} unrepaired Generators closest to each other are revealed to you. Repairing 