de Off&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Trade Off&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Trigger item&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Trigger item&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Try refreshing in a moment&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Try refreshing in a moment&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;turn off to play the next round untimed like ranked&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;turn off to play the next round untimed like ranked&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Twist of Fate&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Twist of Fate&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Type a server name...&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Type a server name...&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;UGC&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;UGC&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Unchain survivors&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Unchain survivors&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Unequip&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Unequip&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;UNHOLY&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;UNHOLY&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;unknown&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;unknown&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Unleash your fury, gaining increased movement speed for {number1} seconds during which you can walk through obstacles. Smashing through a pallet slows you by {number2}% for {number3} seconds, halved if you smash it within {number4} second of the windup ending.&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Unleash your fury, gaining increased movement speed for {number1} seconds during which you can walk through obstacles. Smashing through a pallet slows you by {number2}% for {number3} seconds, halved if you smash it within {number4} second of the windup ending.&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;UNRANKED&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;UNRANKED&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Use / Ready item&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Use / Ready item&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Use your item&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Use your item&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Using pursuit triggers a {number1}-second cooldown.&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Using pursuit triggers a {number1}-second cooldown.&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Utility&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Utility&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Valdelobos Village&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Valdelobos Village&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Vampire Lord&apos;s Scythe&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Vampire Lord&apos;s Scythe&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;VAMPIRE LORD&apos;S SCYTHE&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;VAMPIRE LORD&apos;S SCYTHE&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Vault&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Vault&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;VAULT&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;VAULT&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Vault locations can only take one at a time. Remember to not overcrowd one location!&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Vault locations can only take one at a time. Remember to not overcrowd one location!&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Vault while being chased&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Vault while being chased&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Vaulting any Window or Pallet activates Evasive Manoeuvre for {number1} seconds. While active, the next time you vault a Window or Pallet, do it {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% faster and gain a {number5}% Speed Boost for 4/5/6 seconds, then gain the Winded Status Effect for 40 seconds.\n\n\&quot;Slipped away with ease\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Vaulting any Window or Pallet activates Evasive Manoeuvre for {number1} seconds. While active, the next time you vault a Window or Pallet, do it {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% faster and gain a {number5}% Speed Boost for 4/5/6 seconds, then gain the Winded Status Effect for 40 seconds.\n\n\&quot;Slipped away with ease\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Veil&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Veil&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;VICTORIAK&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;VICTORIAK&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Visual Learner&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Visual Learner&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Vulnerable&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Vulnerable&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Waiting For Next Round&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Waiting For Next Round&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;WALK FASTER&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;WALK FASTER&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Wanwood&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Wanwood&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;WarCry&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;WarCry&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;WARSAW, POLAND&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;WARSAW, POLAND&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Water Balloon&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Water Balloon&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Water Inside Chamber&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Water Inside Chamber&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Wave&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Wave&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;WaxBound Candle&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;WaxBound Candle&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;We don’t need the reason for joy oh yeahhhh.&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;We don’t need the reason for joy oh yeahhhh.&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;We&apos;re Stronger Together&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;We&apos;re Stronger Together&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Weapons&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Weapons&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;WEEK {number1}&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;WEEK {number1}&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;WEEK {number1} REWARDS&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;WEEK {number1} REWARDS&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;When a heal action on another Survivor started by you finishes, you and the healed Survivor gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed boost for {number4} seconds.\n\&quot;Born in blood... both of us.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;When a heal action on another Survivor started by you finishes, you and the healed Survivor gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed boost for {number4} seconds.\n\&quot;Born in blood... both of us.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;When falling from heights, recover {number1}% faster and gain a {number2}% Speed boost for {number3} seconds. This perk does not activate whilst you have the Winded Status Effect. Applies the Winded Status Effect for {number4}/{number5}/50 seconds after triggering.\n\n\&quot;it&apos;s not just cool, it&apos;s practical too.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;When falling from heights, recover {number1}% faster and gain a {number2}% Speed boost for {number3} seconds. This perk does not activate whilst you have the Winded Status Effect. Applies the Winded Status Effect for {number4}/{number5}/50 seconds after triggering.\n\n\&quot;it&apos;s not just cool, it&apos;s practical too.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;When the escape gates are powered, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed boost.\n \n\&quot;I&apos;ll make it out just to spite them.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;When the escape gates are powered, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed boost.\n \n\&quot;I&apos;ll make it out just to spite them.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;When the Escape Gates are powered, heal a Health State and reveal the aura of the Killer for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds.\n\n\&quot;I must stand my ground, through the grief, through the loss, I will pass, for them, for all.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;When the Escape Gates are powered, heal a Health State and reveal the aura of the Killer for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds.\n\n\&quot;I must stand my ground, through the grief, through the loss, I will pass, for them, for all.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;When you are hit by the Killer, reveal their aura for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds to all survivors and immediately slow them by {number4}%/{number5}%/40% for 2.5 seconds. If you are hit while Invulnerable, this slow&apos;s duration is doubled. Abrasive does not work while Winded.\n\n\&quot;Getting closer only gets you farther.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;When you are hit by the Killer, reveal their aura for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds to all survivors and immediately slow them by {number4}%/{number5}%/40% for 2.5 seconds. If you are hit while Invulnerable, this slow&apos;s duration is doubled. Abrasive does not work while Winded.\n\n\&quot;Getting closer only gets you farther.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;When you are injured, Repair Generators {number1}% faster and perform all other actions {number2}% faster. Additionally, recovering any Survivor from the ground while you&apos;re injured grants you {number3}/{number4}/{number5} seconds of Invulnerability.\n\n\&quot;Looking like a true survivor, I&apos;m still standing after all this time\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;When you are injured, Repair Generators {number1}% faster and perform all other actions {number2}% faster. Additionally, recovering any Survivor from the ground while you&apos;re injured grants you {number3}/{number4}/{number5} seconds of Invulnerability.\n\n\&quot;Looking like a true survivor, I&apos;m still standing after all this time\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;When you are the last Survivor alive, reveal the aura of the Killer for {number1} seconds and gain a {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% Escape Gate Opening Speed boost.\n\n\&quot;Still ain&apos;t given up yet.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;When you are the last Survivor alive, reveal the aura of the Killer for {number1} seconds and gain a {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% Escape Gate Opening Speed boost.\n\n\&quot;Still ain&apos;t given up yet.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;When you perform a fast window vault while this perk is active, you vault {number1}% quicker with a special animation. This perk has a cooldown of {number2}/{number3}/{number4} seconds.\n \n\&quot;I understand it now.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;When you perform a fast window vault while this perk is active, you vault {number1}% quicker with a special animation. This perk has a cooldown of {number2}/{number3}/{number4} seconds.\n \n\&quot;I understand it now.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Survivor escapes chase, gain a token, up to a maximum of {number1}. Each token gives you a {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% Speed boost. Performing a basic attack or a special attack that can damage Survivors removes a token.\n\n\&quot;For the love of the game.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Survivor escapes chase, gain a token, up to a maximum of {number1}. Each token gives you a {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% Speed boost. Performing a basic attack or a special attack that can damage Survivors removes a token.\n\n\&quot;For the love of the game.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Survivor sees your aura, you see theirs.\nAdditionally, whenever you gain a speed boost, your aura is revealed to the nearest Survivor for {number1} seconds.\nThis perk has a cooldown of {number2}/{number3}/{number4} seconds.\n\n\&quot;It watches them as they watch it… as though studying symptoms no one else can see.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Survivor sees your aura, you see theirs.\nAdditionally, whenever you gain a speed boost, your aura is revealed to the nearest Survivor for {number1} seconds.\nThis perk has a cooldown of {number2}/{number3}/{number4} seconds.\n\n\&quot;It watches them as they watch it… as though studying symptoms no one else can see.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Survivor stuns you, they gain the Vulnerable Status Effect for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds. The Vulnerable effect has a cooldown of {number4} seconds.\nAdditionally, whenever a Survivor drops a Pallet, they are slowed by {number5}% for 4 seconds. The slowdown has no cooldown.\n\n\&quot;it&apos;s like adding fuel to flame\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Survivor stuns you, they gain the Vulnerable Status Effect for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds. The Vulnerable effect has a cooldown of {number4} seconds.\nAdditionally, whenever a Survivor drops a Pallet, they are slowed by {number5}% for 4 seconds. The slowdown has no cooldown.\n\n\&quot;it&apos;s like adding fuel to flame\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Survivor within your Intent Radius fast vaults, medium vaults, or drops a Pallet, reveal their aura to you for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds. Additionally, all aura reads last {number4} seconds longer. This perk has a cooldown of {number5} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Never again letting them escape.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Survivor within your Intent Radius fast vaults, medium vaults, or drops a Pallet, reveal their aura to you for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds. Additionally, all aura reads last {number4} seconds longer. This perk has a cooldown of {number5} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Never again letting them escape.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Survivor within your Intent Radius fast vaults, medium vaults, or drops a Pallet, reveal their aura to you for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds. Additionally, this perk increases any aura-read duration by {number4} seconds. This perk has a cooldown of {number5} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Never again letting them escape.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Survivor within your Intent Radius fast vaults, medium vaults, or drops a Pallet, reveal their aura to you for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds. Additionally, this perk increases any aura-read duration by {number4} seconds. This perk has a cooldown of {number5} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Never again letting them escape.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Window is blocked within {number1}/{number2}/{number3} studs of you for any reason, gain a {number4}% Speed Boost for {number5} seconds and see the Killer&apos;s aura for the duration. This perk has a 60-second cooldown.\n\n\&quot;Always have a plan B\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever a Window is blocked within {number1}/{number2}/{number3} studs of you for any reason, gain a {number4}% Speed Boost for {number5} seconds and see the Killer&apos;s aura for the duration. This perk has a 60-second cooldown.\n\n\&quot;Always have a plan B\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever any Pallet is dropped, see the aura of the Killer for {number1} seconds. This effect has a cooldown of {number2} seconds. See the aura of dropped Pallets, and gain the ability to recover them to the upright position by crouching near them for {number3}/{number4}/{number5} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Again and again &apos;till my hands give out\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever any Pallet is dropped, see the aura of the Killer for {number1} seconds. This effect has a cooldown of {number2} seconds. See the aura of dropped Pallets, and gain the ability to recover them to the upright position by crouching near them for {number3}/{number4}/{number5} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Again and again &apos;till my hands give out\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever the Killer breaks a Pallet or damages a generator within a {number1} stud range, reveal the aura of the Killer to you for {number2}/{number3}/{number4} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Gosh this guy&apos;s really loud\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever the Killer breaks a Pallet or damages a generator within a {number1} stud range, reveal the aura of the Killer to you for {number2}/{number3}/{number4} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Gosh this guy&apos;s really loud\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever you are in the Terror Radius of the Killer and not in chase, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed Boost and a {number4}/{number5}/10% boost to Healing and Repairing.\n\n\&quot;Nothing more cliche than reusing a perk name\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever you are in the Terror Radius of the Killer and not in chase, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed Boost and a {number4}/{number5}/10% boost to Healing and Repairing.\n\n\&quot;Nothing more cliche than reusing a perk name\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever you are within {number1} studs of any Survivor, every Survivor within the range gains a {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% Speed boost.\n\n\&quot;ape together strong\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever you are within {number1} studs of any Survivor, every Survivor within the range gains a {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% Speed boost.\n\n\&quot;ape together strong\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever you free a Survivor from a Chain, you do it {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% faster and give them a {number4}% Speed Boost for {number5} seconds.\n\n\&quot;U &apos;mirin my biceps brah?\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever you free a Survivor from a Chain, you do it {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% faster and give them a {number4}% Speed Boost for {number5} seconds.\n\n\&quot;U &apos;mirin my biceps brah?\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever you parry, stun, or blind the Killer, the aura of the Killer will be revealed to every Survivor for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Is this an audition or a movie??\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever you parry, stun, or blind the Killer, the aura of the Killer will be revealed to every Survivor for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds.\n\n\&quot;Is this an audition or a movie??\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whenever you stun the Killer using a Pallet, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed boost for {number4} seconds. This perk does not activate whilst you have the Winded Status Effect. Applies the Winded Status Effect for {number5} seconds after triggering.\n \n\&quot;Fighting back is always an option... and running away after.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whenever you stun the Killer using a Pallet, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed boost for {number4} seconds. This perk does not activate whilst you have the Winded Status Effect. Applies the Winded Status Effect for {number5} seconds after triggering.\n \n\&quot;Fighting back is always an option... and running away after.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Where silence hides something alive&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Where silence hides something alive&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;While a Survivor is actively trapped in a Chain, Dread Harvest activates. You gain a stackable {number1}%/{number2}%/{number3}% Speed Boost for each Survivor actively repairing a Generator. Cannot grant its effect within AntiCamp range.\n\n\&quot;You should have been watching him, every minute.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;While a Survivor is actively trapped in a Chain, Dread Harvest activates. You gain a stackable {number1}%/{number2}%/{number3}% Speed Boost for each Survivor actively repairing a Generator. Cannot grant its effect within AntiCamp range.\n\n\&quot;You should have been watching him, every minute.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;While crouched, stop the Killer from revealing your aura. This has a cooldown of {number1} seconds. Additionally, this perk increases your crouching speed by {number2}/{number3}/{number4}%.\n\n\&quot;HSSSSSSSSSS - a snake idk\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;While crouched, stop the Killer from revealing your aura. This has a cooldown of {number1} seconds. Additionally, this perk increases your crouching speed by {number2}/{number3}/{number4}%.\n\n\&quot;HSSSSSSSSSS - a snake idk\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;While injured, Repair Generators {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% faster, and Heal yourself or other Survivors, vault Windows and Pallets, Unchain other Survivors and open Exit Gates {number4}/{number5}/10% faster.\n\n\&quot;Looking like a true survivor, I&apos;m still standing after all this time\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;While injured, Repair Generators {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% faster, and Heal yourself or other Survivors, vault Windows and Pallets, Unchain other Survivors and open Exit Gates {number4}/{number5}/10% faster.\n\n\&quot;Looking like a true survivor, I&apos;m still standing after all this time\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whilst not being in chase, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed boost. This perk deactivates if there is a Survivor within {number4} studs.\n\n\&quot;Absolute cinema\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whilst not being in chase, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed boost. This perk deactivates if there is a Survivor within {number4} studs.\n\n\&quot;Absolute cinema\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whilst not being in chase, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed boost. When getting within {number4} studs of a Survivor, this perk deactivates and you gain {number5}/5/7 seconds of Undetectable. The Undetectable has a cooldown of 45 seconds.\n\n\&quot;Absolute cinema\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whilst not being in chase, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% Speed boost. When getting within {number4} studs of a Survivor, this perk deactivates and you gain {number5}/5/7 seconds of Undetectable. The Undetectable has a cooldown of 45 seconds.\n\n\&quot;Absolute cinema\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Whilst you are in a chase, Survivors within {number1} studs will gain a {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% Action Speed boost and have their aura revealed to you.\n\n\&quot;Ladies, I&apos;ve got this\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Whilst you are in a chase, Survivors within {number1} studs will gain a {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% Action Speed boost and have their aura revealed to you.\n\n\&quot;Ladies, I&apos;ve got this\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;who is joe?&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;who is joe?&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Why did he hit every beat?&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Why did he hit every beat?&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;WIGGLE&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;WIGGLE&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Wili&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Wili&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Witch&apos;s Broom&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Witch&apos;s Broom&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;WITCH&apos;S BROOM&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;WITCH&apos;S BROOM&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Witch&apos;s Cauldron&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Witch&apos;s Cauldron&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Woah! Nice! Cool!&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Woah! Nice! Cool!&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Woodview Cabin&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Woodview Cabin&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Worth&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Worth&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Wren&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Wren&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;XP: {number1} / {number2}&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;XP: {number1} / {number2}&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Yb better&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Yb better&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Years of hardship to escape this nightmare made you all familiar with each other.\nThe aura of other Survivors is revealed to you within an {number1}/{number2}/{number3} stud range. Survivors revealed this way also see your aura.\n\&quot;You spend enough time with someone, you don’t need eyes to find them.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Years of hardship to escape this nightmare made you all familiar with each other.\nThe aura of other Survivors is revealed to you within an {number1}/{number2}/{number3} stud range. Survivors revealed this way also see your aura.\n\&quot;You spend enough time with someone, you don’t need eyes to find them.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Yes&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Yes&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;You&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;You&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;You leave bloody messes wherever you go. Whenever you land a basic attack on a survivor, they will release blood {number1}× as frequently, and suffer a {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% slowdown to healing on that survivor.\n\n\n\&quot;Who cares about inexperience if you leave a lasting impression.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;You leave bloody messes wherever you go. Whenever you land a basic attack on a survivor, they will release blood {number1}× as frequently, and suffer a {number2}/{number3}/{number4}% slowdown to healing on that survivor.\n\n\n\&quot;Who cares about inexperience if you leave a lasting impression.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;You need at least one item and {number1} survivor perks\nto join ranked.&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;You need at least one item and {number1} survivor perks\nto join ranked.&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;You walk {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% faster. This does not apply while crouching or sprinting.\nRecover from the Winded Status Effect {number4}/{number5}/15% faster, and from all other negative Status Effects 10/15/20% faster.\n\n\&quot;100 Push-Up&apos;s, 100 Sit-Up&apos;s, 100 Squats and a 10 Kilometer run EVERY, SINGLE, DAY!\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;You walk {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% faster. This does not apply while crouching or sprinting.\nRecover from the Winded Status Effect {number4}/{number5}/15% faster, and from all other negative Status Effects 10/15/20% faster.\n\n\&quot;100 Push-Up&apos;s, 100 Sit-Up&apos;s, 100 Squats and a 10 Kilometer run EVERY, SINGLE, DAY!\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;You will leave this server and join the ranked lobby.&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;You will leave this server and join the ranked lobby.&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;You&apos;re only precise when it matters the most.\nWhilst healing a Survivor in the dying state, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% increase to Healing Speed and reveal the aura of the Killer.\n\n\&quot;My destiny is in no man&apos;s hand but mine.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;You&apos;re only precise when it matters the most.\nWhilst healing a Survivor in the dying state, gain a {number1}/{number2}/{number3}% increase to Healing Speed and reveal the aura of the Killer.\n\n\&quot;My destiny is in no man&apos;s hand but mine.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Your blows are calculated and efficient. Damaging a Survivor by any means applies the Winded status effect for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds. Additionally, you recover from successful basic attacks {number4} seconds sooner.\n \n\&quot;Yes I like hurting people.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Your blows are calculated and efficient. Damaging a Survivor by any means applies the Winded status effect for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds. Additionally, you recover from successful basic attacks {number4} seconds sooner.\n \n\&quot;Yes I like hurting people.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Your Heart Is Mine :&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Your Heart Is Mine :&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Your ingenuity always puts you one step ahead. Hold to activate the Tracker. Its beeps become faster and higher-pitched as the Killer draws near. While active, it also reveals the auras of teammates within {number1} studs who have run within the last second.\n\&quot;Wee Woo\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Your ingenuity always puts you one step ahead. Hold to activate the Tracker. Its beeps become faster and higher-pitched as the Killer draws near. While active, it also reveals the auras of teammates within {number1} studs who have run within the last second.\n\&quot;Wee Woo\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Your plot armor always comes in clutch.\nWhenever you heal from the dying state by any means, gain the Invulnerable Status Effect for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds. Additionally, you can pick yourself up from the dying state once per round.\n\n\&quot;Did you really think I was some random?\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Your plot armor always comes in clutch.\nWhenever you heal from the dying state by any means, gain the Invulnerable Status Effect for {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds. Additionally, you can pick yourself up from the dying state once per round.\n\n\&quot;Did you really think I was some random?\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;YOUR RANK&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;YOUR RANK&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Your willpower transcends torment.\nWhilst trapped in a Chain, your aura is hidden from the Killer. Additionally, this perk decreases the lifetime of your blood pools by {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds.\n\n\&quot;What do you mean I&apos;m Chained? I&apos;m perfectly fine.\&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Your willpower transcends torment.\nWhilst trapped in a Chain, your aura is hidden from the Killer. Additionally, this perk decreases the lifetime of your blood pools by {number1}/{number2}/{number3} seconds.\n\n\&quot;What do you mean I&apos;m Chained? I&apos;m perfectly fine.\&quot;&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;YOUSEF&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;YOUSEF&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Yuki&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Yuki&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;yyu&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;yyu&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Zen&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Zen&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Zero&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Zero&quot;}},{&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Zii&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:{&quot;en-us&quot;:&quot;Zii&quot;}}]</string>
<string name="Name">LocalizationTable</string>
<string name="SourceLocaleId">en-us</string>
</Properties>
</Item>
